"d":"2018-08-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"So that's -- and then as we've said, we're able to pass a lot of that along many of our contracts but there is just a trailing impact that it has on getting your FOB prices up and then the contracts that you don't to pass through it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/11/construction-parnters-road-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"ROAD 2018 Q3","e":"road","d":"2018-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Charles Owens","x":"What makes us differ from many of our larger private company peers in the civil construction sector is that our projects are mostly recurring road restructuring projects with an average contract duration of eight months and smaller contract size.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/11/construction-parnters-road-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"ROAD 2018 Q3","e":"road","d":"2018-08-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"For fiscal 2018, we're maintaining the outlook we've previously provided.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/11/construction-parnters-road-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"ROAD 2019 Q2","e":"road","d":"2019-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"We have raised the outlook with regard to revenue, net income, and adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/construction-partners-inc-road-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ROAD 2019 Q3","e":"road","d":"2019-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"Based on our strong backlog and continued operational performance, we are maintaining our outlook for fiscal year 2019 with regard to revenue, net income and adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/construction-partners-inc-road-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ROAD 2020 Q1","e":"road","d":"2020-02-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"We are maintaining our full-year outlook for fiscal 2020 based on our historical experience of generating approximately 40% of our revenue in the first half of the fiscal year and approximately 60% during the second half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/construction-partners-inc-road-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ROAD 2020 Q2","e":"road","d":"2020-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"But as we've said before, most of the asphalt cement is a pass-through cost on our jobs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/construction-partners-inc-road-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ROAD 2020 Q3","e":"road","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"So we still have the same margin on that work because you all you give back is the cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/08/construction-partners-inc-road-q3-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q1","e":"road","d":"2021-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"We continue to have favorable pricing on liquid asphalt and diesel fuel during most of the quarter where we're beginning to see the expected price increases in both of these products as the economy begins to recover.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/05/construction-partners-inc-road-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q1","e":"road","d":"2021-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"And then when you have the headwind when they're going up during the period that they're going up because you don't have every contract hedged and with the price increases that are built into it, then you may have $1 million or $1.5 million of headwind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/05/construction-partners-inc-road-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q2","e":"road","d":"2021-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"As expected we experienced price increases on liquid asphalt and diesel fuel during most of this quarter, but we are seeing some stabilization in prices for both of these products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/construction-partners-inc-road-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q2","e":"road","d":"2021-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Feniger","x":"And if you are going to see this higher increase of federal investment, can you be more selective and can we see pricing power actually come through with what you're going to be bidding on going forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/construction-partners-inc-road-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q2","e":"road","d":"2021-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jule Smith","x":"We are maintaining our outlook for the fiscal year and we see significant opportunities for CPI, both near term and long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/construction-partners-inc-road-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q2","e":"road","d":"2021-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alan Palmer","x":"And that's one of the reasons that we maintained our guidance because while these acquisitions significantly impacted this quarter, the full year, they're going to have a positive impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/construction-partners-inc-road-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q3","e":"road","d":"2021-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rick Black","x":"You know at CPI, one of the things we've talked about is inflation is mainly a pass-through costs for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/construction-partners-inc-road-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q4","e":"road","d":"2021-11-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fred J. Smith","x":"We anticipate continuing inflation in fiscal year 2022 and our pass-through mechanisms and contingencies and bids have been adjusted accordingly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/construction-partners-inc-road-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2021 Q4","e":"road","d":"2021-11-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fred J. Smith","x":"Although, we don't know when the labor market and supply chain constraints will ease, we have adapted and are managing the disruptions and we'll pass the cost through until market dynamics ultimately return business to normal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/construction-partners-inc-road-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ROAD 2026 Q1","e":"road","d":"2026-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Gregory A. Hoffman","x":"Which I will review in more detail before discussing our raised outlook ranges, and then we will open the call to questions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/construction-partners-road-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ROAD 2026 Q2","e":"road","d":"2026-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"F. Smith","x":"As we look to the future relative to building our backlog, our pass-through cost model reacts quickly to rising commodity prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/road-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ROAD 2026 Q2","e":"road","d":"2026-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"F. Smith","x":"Liquid asphalt, over half of what we use now is internally sourced and we have -- it's our goal to grow it as part of our vertical integration strategy to enhance and grow our margin profile being able to source more of our liquid internally at the wholesale and pass it through at retail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/road-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ROAD 2026 Q2","e":"road","d":"2026-05-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"F. Smith","x":